          "signature": "bounded_mergeWidth_linearNeighborhoodComplexity : ∀ (C : Lax9.MergeWidth.GraphClass),\n  Lax9.MergeWidth.BoundedMergeWidth C → Lax9.NeighborhoodComplexity.LinearNeighborhoodComplexity C",
